#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:142
msgctxt "@info:status a stream"
msgid "The server's certificate has expired, or isn't valid yet"
msgstr "Le certificat du serveur a expiré ou n'est pas encore valide"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:144
msgctxt "@info:status a stream"
msgid "The server's certificate is for another name than the host"
msgstr "Le certificat du serveur porte un autre nom que celui de l'hôte"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:146
msgctxt "@info:status a stream"
msgid "The server's certificate was refused"
msgstr "Le certificat du serveur a été refusé"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:148
msgctxt "@info:status a stream"
msgid "The server offers no secure connection this computer accepts"
msgstr ""
"Le serveur ne propose aucune connexion sécurisée acceptée par cet ordinateur"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:150
msgctxt "@info:status a stream"
msgid "The secure connection broke off"
msgstr "La connexion sécurisée a été interrompue"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:152
msgctxt "@info:status a stream"
msgid "This computer's trusted certificate authorities couldn't be read"
msgstr ""
"Les autorités de certification reconnues par cet ordinateur n'ont pas pu être"
" lues"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:154
msgctxt "@info:status a stream"
msgid "The stream stopped"
msgstr "Le flux s'est arrêté"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:22
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"Sends the sound that reaches it to a video streaming service, with a picture "
"made for it, and passes the sound on unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Envoie le son qui lui parvient à un service de diffusion vidéo, avec une "
"image créée pour lui, et transmet le son inchangé."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:27
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"Services that take a live stream expect video, even for a radio show or a set"
" of music. So the block draws a picture for the sound: a title, a line or two"
" of words, what is playing, and something that moves with the sound, over a "
"colour or a picture of your own."
msgstr ""
"Les services qui acceptent une diffusion en direct attendent de la vidéo, "
"même pour une émission de radio ou un set musical. Le bloc dessine donc une "
"image pour le son : un titre, une ou deux lignes de texte, ce qui est en "
"cours de lecture, et un élément qui bouge avec le son, sur une couleur ou une"
" image de votre choix."

#. i18n: RTMP and RTMPS are the names of protocols, the same in every language.
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:29
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"It sends both to the service over RTMP or RTMPS, the way most streaming "
"services take a live stream. You need the service's address and your stream "
"key, from the service's page for going live."
msgstr ""
"Il envoie les deux au service via RTMP ou RTMPS, la méthode qu'utilisent la "
"plupart des services de diffusion pour recevoir le direct. Il vous faut "
"l'adresse du service et votre clé de flux, indiquées sur la page du service "
"consacrée au direct."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:30
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"The block connects when you start the session and lets go when you stop it. "
"The sound also goes on through the block as it is, so the lane can carry on "
"to your speakers or a Recorder."
msgstr ""
"Le bloc se connecte quand vous lancez la session et se déconnecte quand vous "
"l'arrêtez. Le son traverse aussi le bloc tel quel, si bien que la rangée peut"
" continuer vers vos haut-parleurs ou un bloc Enregistreur."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:31
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"The picture keeps time with the sound however long the stream runs. If the "
"computer is too busy to draw every frame, it leaves some out rather than let "
"the sound wait."
msgstr ""
"L'image reste synchronisée avec le son, quelle que soit la durée de la "
"diffusion. Si l'ordinateur est trop occupé pour dessiner chaque image, il en "
"omet certaines plutôt que de faire attendre le son."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:32
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"The line at the top of its settings says what it is doing. If the service or "
"the network goes away, the block tries again after a second, then waits twice"
" as long each time, up to a minute. A missing stream key, or a computer that "
"cannot make the video, stops it until you change something."
msgstr ""
"La ligne en haut de ses réglages indique ce qu'il fait. Si le service ou le "
"réseau disparaît, le bloc réessaie au bout d'une seconde, puis attend deux "
"fois plus longtemps à chaque fois, jusqu'à une minute. Une clé de flux "
"manquante, ou un ordinateur incapable de produire la vidéo, l'arrête jusqu'à "
"ce que vous changiez quelque chose."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:37
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:285
msgctxt "@title:tab a Live Stream block's settings"
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "Configuration"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:39
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"Where the stream goes, and how big its picture is. A change here while it is "
"on the air makes the block connect again."
msgstr ""
"La destination du flux et la taille de son image. Une modification ici "
"pendant la diffusion fait se reconnecter le bloc."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:45
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:321
msgctxt "@label:textbox a video service's RTMP address"
msgid "Server"
msgstr "Serveur"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:47
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"The service's address for live streams, copied as the service gives it. It "
"starts with rtmps:// or rtmp://. A new block has none, so nothing is sent "
"anywhere until you fill it in."
msgstr ""
"L'adresse du service pour les diffusions en direct, copiée telle que le "
"service la donne. Elle commence par rtmps:// ou rtmp://. Un nouveau bloc n'en"
" a aucune : rien n'est donc envoyé nulle part tant que vous ne l'avez pas "
"remplie."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:48
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"Choose the rtmps:// address where the service offers one. The stream is then "
"encrypted on its way, and the block checks that the server is really the one "
"named."
msgstr ""
"Choisissez l'adresse rtmps:// si le service en propose une. Le flux est alors"
" chiffré pendant son trajet, et le bloc vérifie que le serveur est bien celui"
" indiqué."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:54
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:340
msgctxt "@label:textbox the secret key a video service gives for streaming"
msgid "Stream key"
msgstr "Clé de flux"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:55
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:368
msgctxt "@action:button remove a live stream's stored key"
msgid "Forget Stream Key"
msgstr "Oublier la clé de flux"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:57
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"The secret code that tells the service the stream is yours. Paste it and "
"press Enter. Anyone who has it can stream on your channel, so keep it to "
"yourself."
msgstr ""
"Le code secret qui indique au service que le flux vient bien de vous. Collez-"
"le et appuyez sur Entrée. Toute personne qui le possède peut diffuser sur "
"votre chaîne : gardez-le pour vous."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:58
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"It is kept in your desktop's password store, never in the session file. The "
"box then empties and says Stored; type in it again to replace the key. The "
"button beside it forgets the key altogether."
msgstr ""
"La clé est conservée dans le gestionnaire de mots de passe de votre bureau, "
"jamais dans le fichier de la session. Le champ se vide alors et affiche "
"Mémorisée ; saisissez-y de nouveau du texte pour remplacer la clé. Le bouton "
"à côté oublie complètement la clé."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:64
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:388
msgctxt "@label:listbox a live stream's size and frame rate"
msgid "Quality"
msgstr "Qualité"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:66
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"How big the picture is, and how many times a second it changes. A bigger "
"picture needs a faster upload:"
msgstr ""
"La taille de l'image, et le nombre de fois par seconde où elle change. Une "
"image plus grande exige un débit montant plus élevé :"

#. i18n: kbps stands for kilobits per second.
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:70
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block, a choice of Quality"
msgid ""
"Good: 1024 × 576, 15 frames a second. For a slow connection; it sends about "
"900 kbps in all."
msgstr ""
"Bonne : 1024 × 576, 15 images par seconde. Pour une connexion lente ; elle "
"envoie environ 900 kbit/s au total."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:71
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block, a choice of Quality"
msgid ""
"Higher: 1280 × 720, 30 frames a second, what a new block uses. It sends about"
" 2,600 kbps."
msgstr ""
"Élevée : 1280 × 720, 30 images par seconde, le choix d'un nouveau bloc. Elle "
"envoie environ 2 600 kbit/s."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:72
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block, a choice of Quality"
msgid "Best: 1920 × 1080, 30 frames a second. It sends about 4,800 kbps."
msgstr ""
"Maximale : 1920 × 1080, 30 images par seconde. Elle envoie environ "
"4 800 kbit/s."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:75
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"The better the quality, the better the sound as well: Best sends the sound at"
" 320 kbps, Higher at 128 and Good at 96."
msgstr ""
"Meilleure est la qualité, meilleur est aussi le son : Maximale envoie le son "
"à 320 kbit/s, Élevée à 128 et Bonne à 96."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:81
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:407
msgctxt "@label:listbox what makes a live stream's video"
msgid "Encoder"
msgstr "Encodeur"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:83
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"What turns the pictures into video. The list offers only the ones that work "
"on this computer:"
msgstr ""
"Ce qui transforme les images en vidéo. La liste ne propose que les encodeurs "
"qui fonctionnent sur cet ordinateur :"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:86
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block, a choice of Encoder"
msgid ""
"The best one here: what a new block uses. It tries the graphics card first, "
"then the others."
msgstr ""
"Le meilleur disponible : le choix d'un nouveau bloc. Il essaie d'abord la "
"carte graphique, puis les autres."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:87
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block, a choice of Encoder"
msgid ""
"A graphics card: the card does the work, which costs the processor almost "
"nothing."
msgstr ""
"Une carte graphique : la carte fait le travail, ce qui ne coûte presque rien "
"au processeur."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:88
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block, a choice of Encoder"
msgid ""
"x264 and OpenH264: the processor does the work, which can keep a slow "
"computer busy."
msgstr ""
"x264 et OpenH264 : le processeur fait le travail, ce qui peut fortement "
"occuper un ordinateur lent."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:91
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"If the encoder you chose will not start, the block uses the next one that "
"does. If none works, a line at the top of the tab says what to install."
msgstr ""
"Si l'encodeur choisi ne démarre pas, le bloc utilise le suivant qui démarre. "
"Si aucun ne fonctionne, une ligne en haut de l'onglet indique quoi installer."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:96
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:286
msgctxt "@title:tab a Live Stream block's settings"
msgid "Picture"
msgstr "Image"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:98
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"What the picture shows. A change here only redraws it; the stream goes on."
msgstr ""
"Ce que montre l'image. Une modification ici ne fait que la redessiner ; la "
"diffusion continue."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:104
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:435
msgctxt "@label:textbox the large words on a live stream's picture"
msgid "Title"
msgstr "Titre"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:106
#, c-format
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"The large words on the picture. A new block shows the session's name, which "
"is what %session stands for; type your own words instead."
msgstr ""
"Le texte en grand sur l'image. Un nouveau bloc affiche le nom de la session, "
"que représente %session ; saisissez vos propres mots à la place."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:112
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:452
msgctxt "@label:textbox the words under a live stream's title"
msgid "Subtitle"
msgstr "Sous-titre"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:114
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"A smaller line under the title, such as the name of the show or when it is "
"on. Leave it empty for none."
msgstr ""
"Une ligne plus petite sous le titre, comme le nom de l'émission ou son "
"horaire. Laissez-la vide pour ne rien afficher."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:120
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:468
msgctxt ""
"@label:textbox how what is playing is shown on a live stream's picture"
msgid "Now playing as"
msgstr "Affichage de la lecture"

#. i18n: %artist, %title, %album and %session are typed as they are and must
#. not be translated.
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:123
#, c-format
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"The line that says what is playing. Type your own words with the pieces "
"%artist, %title and %album, filled in from Now playing below, and %session, "
"the session's name. A new block uses %artist - %title."
msgstr ""
"La ligne qui indique ce qui est en cours de lecture. Saisissez vos propres "
"mots avec les éléments %artist, %title et %album, remplis d'après En cours de"
" lecture plus bas, et %session, le nom de la session. Un nouveau bloc utilise"
" %artist - %title."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:124
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"Words between two pieces are left out when either is empty, so a track with "
"no artist shows its title alone. When nothing is known, the line is left off "
"the picture."
msgstr ""
"Les mots placés entre deux éléments sont omis quand l'un d'eux est vide : un "
"morceau sans artiste affiche donc son titre seul. Quand rien n'est connu, la "
"ligne n'apparaît pas sur l'image."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:125
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"Once the stream is on the air, a line under Now playing shows what the "
"picture says now."
msgstr ""
"Une fois le flux à l'antenne, une ligne sous En cours de lecture montre ce "
"qu'affiche alors l'image."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:138
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid "Where the block learns what is playing, as a Broadcast block does:"
msgstr ""
"La source qui indique au bloc ce qui est en cours de lecture, comme pour un "
"bloc Diffusion radio :"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:141
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block, a choice of Now playing"
msgid "Only the template: nothing is learned. What a new block uses."
msgstr ""
"Le modèle seul : rien n'est récupéré. C'est le choix d'un nouveau bloc."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:142
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block, a choice of Now playing"
msgid ""
"A text file: its first line is the title. Many music players can write such a"
" file. Type its place in the File box, or choose it with the button beside "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Un fichier texte : sa première ligne est le titre. De nombreux lecteurs de "
"musique savent écrire un tel fichier. Saisissez son emplacement dans le champ"
" Fichier, ou choisissez-le avec le bouton à côté."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:143
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block, a choice of Now playing"
msgid ""
"A media player: the block asks a player on this computer what it is playing. "
"The one this session captures follows a player whose sound the session's "
"Application blocks take, or whichever is playing when they take none. Or "
"choose a player by name."
msgstr ""
"Un lecteur multimédia : le bloc demande à un lecteur de cet ordinateur ce "
"qu'il lit. Celui que capture cette session suit un lecteur dont les blocs "
"Application de la session prennent le son, ou celui qui joue quand ils n'en "
"prennent aucun. Vous pouvez aussi choisir un lecteur par son nom."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:149
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:506
msgctxt "@label:listbox what moves with the sound in a live stream's picture"
msgid "Moving"
msgstr "Animation"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:151
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"What moves with the sound, under the words, so viewers can see the stream is "
"live:"
msgstr ""
"Ce qui bouge avec le son, sous le texte, pour que les spectateurs voient que "
"la diffusion est en direct :"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:154
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block, a choice of Moving"
msgid ""
"Waveform: the shape of the sound as a moving line. What a new block shows."
msgstr ""
"Forme d'onde : le contour du son, en ligne mouvante. C'est ce qu'affiche un "
"nouveau bloc."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:155
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block, a choice of Moving"
msgid "Spectrum: bars that rise and fall with the low, middle and high sounds."
msgstr ""
"Spectre : des barres qui montent et descendent avec les sons graves, médiums "
"et aigus."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:156
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block, a choice of Moving"
msgid "Level meter: a bar across for each side, showing how loud it is."
msgstr ""
"Indicateur de niveau : une barre horizontale pour chaque côté, qui montre son"
" volume."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:157
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block, a choice of Moving"
msgid "Nothing: a still picture."
msgstr "Rien : une image fixe."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:163
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:525
msgctxt "@label:textbox a live stream's background colour"
msgid "Background"
msgstr "Fond"

#. i18n: keep the colour code #16181d as it is.
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:166
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"The colour behind everything, as a colour code: a # and six letters and "
"numbers, such as #16181d, the dark grey a new block uses. The square beside "
"the box shows the colour."
msgstr ""
"La couleur derrière tout le reste, sous forme de code couleur : un # suivi de"
" six lettres et chiffres, par exemple #16181d, le gris foncé d'un nouveau "
"bloc. Le carré à côté du champ montre la couleur."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:172
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:551
msgctxt "@label:textbox a picture covering a live stream's frame"
msgid "Background picture"
msgstr "Image de fond"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:173
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:210
msgctxt "@action:button choose a picture for a live stream"
msgid "Choose Picture…"
msgstr "Choisir une image…"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:175
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"A picture to cover the whole frame instead of the colour. Type the file's "
"place, or choose it with the button beside the box. Leave it empty for none."
msgstr ""
"Une image qui couvre tout le cadre à la place de la couleur. Saisissez "
"l'emplacement du fichier, ou choisissez-le avec le bouton à côté du champ. "
"Laissez le champ vide pour ne pas en mettre."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:181
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:558
msgctxt "@label:textbox a picture at the corner of a live stream's frame"
msgid "Logo"
msgstr "Logo"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:183
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"A small picture at the top left, such as the logo of your show. Choose it as "
"you choose the background picture."
msgstr ""
"Une petite image en haut à gauche, comme le logo de votre émission. "
"Choisissez-la comme l'image de fond."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:184
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"The words are light or dark, whichever reads best over what is behind them, "
"with a shade around them so that a busy picture does not swallow them."
msgstr ""
"Le texte est clair ou foncé, selon ce qui se lit le mieux sur ce qu'il y a "
"derrière, avec une ombre autour pour qu'une image chargée ne l'engloutisse "
"pas."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:189
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:287
msgctxt "@title:tab a Live Stream block's settings"
msgid "Status"
msgstr "État"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:191
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"How the stream is going, while the session runs. Nothing here can be changed:"
msgstr ""
"L'état du flux, pendant que la session est en cours. Rien ici ne peut être "
"modifié :"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:194
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block, a line of the Status tab"
msgid ""
"Connected for, Sent and Upload: how long it has been on the air, how much it "
"has sent, and at what rate."
msgstr ""
"Connecté depuis, Envoyé et Débit montant : la durée passée à l'antenne, la "
"quantité envoyée et à quel débit."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:195
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block, a line of the Status tab"
msgid "Video: the picture's size, its frames a second and the encoder at work."
msgstr ""
"Vidéo : la taille de l'image, son nombre d'images par seconde et l'encodeur "
"utilisé."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:196
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block, a line of the Status tab"
msgid ""
"Frames: how many frames it has sent, and how many it left out because the "
"computer fell behind. If that second number keeps growing, choose a lower "
"quality or another encoder."
msgstr ""
"Images : le nombre d'images envoyées, et le nombre d'images omises parce que "
"l'ordinateur a pris du retard. Si ce second nombre ne cesse d'augmenter, "
"choisissez une qualité plus faible ou un autre encodeur."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:197
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block, a line of the Status tab"
msgid ""
"Reconnects and Last problem: how many times it had to connect again, and what"
" last went wrong."
msgstr ""
"Reconnexions et Dernier problème : le nombre de fois où il a dû se "
"reconnecter, et ce qui a mal fonctionné en dernier."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:204
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"You want to stream a radio show, a podcast or music to a video service, with "
"no camera."
msgstr ""
"Vous voulez diffuser une émission de radio, un podcast ou de la musique sur "
"un service vidéo, sans caméra."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:205
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid "You want viewers to see the title of each song as it plays."
msgstr ""
"Vous voulez que les spectateurs voient le titre de chaque chanson pendant "
"qu'elle passe."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:212
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"If the service lets you stream privately first, try it there, and watch it on"
" another device, before you go public."
msgstr ""
"Si le service vous permet d'abord de diffuser en privé, faites un essai ainsi"
" et regardez le résultat sur un autre appareil avant de passer en public."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:213
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"Put a Peak/RMS meter before the block and keep the level out of the red: "
"viewers hear any crackle too."
msgstr ""
"Placez un bloc Crête/RMS avant ce bloc et gardez le niveau hors du rouge : "
"les spectateurs entendent eux aussi le moindre grésillement."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:214
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"Start with Higher. If the Frames line on the Status tab shows frames left "
"out, or your connection struggles, choose Good."
msgstr ""
"Commencez par Élevée. Si la ligne Images de l'onglet État signale des images "
"omises, ou si votre connexion peine, choisissez Bonne."

#. i18n: openh264 is the name of a package, typed as it is.
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:216
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"If the computer has no encoder that works, install Cisco's OpenH264, on "
"Fedora the openh264 package, or the full FFmpeg."
msgstr ""
"Si l'ordinateur n'a aucun encodeur qui fonctionne, installez OpenH264 de "
"Cisco, sous Fedora le paquet openh264, ou la version complète de FFmpeg."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:203
msgctxt "@info:placeholder a picture file"
msgid "None"
msgstr "Aucune"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:313
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"This system has no H.264 encoder that works, so it can't stream video. "
"Install Cisco's OpenH264 (on Fedora, the openh264 package), or the full "
"FFmpeg."
msgstr ""
"Ce système n'a aucun encodeur H.264 qui fonctionne : il ne peut donc pas "
"diffuser de vidéo. Installez OpenH264 de Cisco (sous Fedora, le paquet "
"openh264), ou la version complète de FFmpeg."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:329
msgctxt "@info:placeholder the start of an RTMP address; keep it as it is"
msgid "rtmps://…"
msgstr "rtmps://…"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:331
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid "Server"
msgstr "Serveur"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:351
msgctxt "@info:placeholder a stream key is stored; typing replaces it"
msgid "Stored. Type a new one to replace it."
msgstr "Mémorisée. Saisissez-en une nouvelle pour la remplacer."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:353
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid "Stream key"
msgstr "Clé de flux"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:357
msgctxt "@info a stream key field, as a screen reader reads it"
msgid "Stream key for the service"
msgstr "Clé de flux du service"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:380
msgctxt "@info where a live stream's key is kept"
msgid "Kept in your system's password store, never in the session file."
msgstr ""
"Conservée dans le gestionnaire de mots de passe de votre système, jamais dans"
" le fichier de la session."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:398
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:393
msgctxt "@label:listbox"
msgid "Quality"
msgstr "Qualité"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:419
msgctxt "@label:listbox"
msgid "Encoder"
msgstr "Encodeur"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:459
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid "Subtitle"
msgstr "Sous-titre"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:476
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid "Now playing as"
msgstr "Affichage de la lecture"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:482
#, c-format
msgctxt ""
"@info the tokens of a live stream's words; keep the %-words as they are"
msgid ""
"%artist, %title and %album are what is playing; %session is the session's "
"name."
msgstr ""
"%artist, %title et %album désignent ce qui est en cours de lecture ; %session"
" est le nom de la session."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:497
msgctxt "@info %1 is what a live stream's picture says is playing now"
msgid "The picture says: %1"
msgstr "L'image affiche : %1"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:516
msgctxt "@label:listbox"
msgid "Moving"
msgstr "Animation"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:543
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid "Background"
msgstr "Fond"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:562
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"The words are light or dark, whichever reads best over what is behind them."
msgstr ""
"Le texte est clair ou foncé, selon ce qui se lit le mieux sur ce qu'il y a "
"derrière."

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:571
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Choose a Picture"
msgstr "Choisir une image"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:572
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox a file type"
msgid "Pictures (*.png *.jpg *.jpeg *.webp *.bmp)"
msgstr "Images (*.png *.jpg *.jpeg *.webp *.bmp)"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:573
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/NowPlayingRows.qml:179
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox a file type"
msgid "All files (*)"
msgstr "Tous les fichiers (*)"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:606
msgctxt "@label the rate a stream is going out at, measured"
msgid "Upload"
msgstr "Débit montant"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:618
msgctxt "@label a live stream's picture size, frame rate and encoder"
msgid "Video"
msgstr "Vidéo"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:626
msgctxt "@info %1 × %2 is a picture's size, %3 frames a second, %4 the encoder"
msgid "%1 × %2, %3 fps, %4"
msgstr "%1 × %2, %3 im/s, %4"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:632
msgctxt "@label frames a live stream sent, and left out"
msgid "Frames"
msgstr "Images"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:639
msgctxt "@info %1 frames sent, %2 left out because the computer fell behind"
msgid "%1 sent, %2 left out"
msgstr "Envoyées : %1, omises : %2"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamWords.qml:28
msgctxt "@item a live stream's quality"
msgid "Good: 1024 × 576, 15 frames a second"
msgstr "Bonne : 1024 × 576, 15 images par seconde"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamWords.qml:30
msgctxt "@item a live stream's quality"
msgid "Higher: 1280 × 720, 30 frames a second"
msgstr "Élevée : 1280 × 720, 30 images par seconde"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamWords.qml:32
msgctxt "@item a live stream's quality"
msgid "Best: 1920 × 1080, 30 frames a second"
msgstr "Maximale : 1920 × 1080, 30 images par seconde"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamWords.qml:40
msgctxt "@item a video encoder"
msgid "The best one here"
msgstr "Le meilleur disponible"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamWords.qml:42
msgctxt "@item a video encoder"
msgid "Graphics card (VA-API)"
msgstr "Carte graphique (VA-API)"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamWords.qml:44
msgctxt "@item a video encoder"
msgid "NVIDIA graphics card (NVENC)"
msgstr "Carte graphique NVIDIA (NVENC)"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamWords.qml:46
msgctxt "@item a video encoder"
msgid "x264 (software)"
msgstr "x264 (logiciel)"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamWords.qml:48
msgctxt "@item a video encoder"
msgid "OpenH264 (software)"
msgstr "OpenH264 (logiciel)"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamWords.qml:56
msgctxt "@item what moves with the sound in a live stream's picture"
msgid "Nothing"
msgstr "Rien"

